@startuml
title Ciclo de vida del despliegue de IntenCite

top to bottom direction

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2563EB
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
    BorderColor #2563EB
    FontColor #0F172A
    StartColor #16A34A
    EndColor #DC2626
}

state "1. Credenciales temporales\nAWS Academy" as Credentials
state "2. GitHub Actions\nDeploy IntenCite" as Deploy
state "3. Inicialización de Terraform\nState remoto en Amazon S3" as State
state "4. Construcción y publicación\nAPI + App en Amazon ECR" as Images
state "5. Terraform apply\nCreación de infraestructura" as Apply
state "6. IntenCite disponible\nmediante la URL del ALB" as Running
state "7. GitHub Actions\nDestroy IntenCite" as Destroy
state "8. Terraform destroy\nEliminación de recursos y state" as Cleanup

[*] --> Credentials

Credentials --> Deploy : workflow_dispatch

Deploy --> State : STS obtiene Account ID
State --> Images : Backend inicializado
Images --> Apply : Imágenes publicadas

Apply --> Running : ALB + ECS/Fargate\nECR + CloudWatch

Running --> Destroy : Cuando finaliza el uso
Destroy --> Cleanup : Recupera el mismo state
Cleanup --> [*] : Cuenta limpia

note right of Credentials
GitHub Actions Secrets:

AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
AWS_SESSION_TOKEN
end note

note right of State
Bucket dinámico:

intencite-tfstate-<ACCOUNT_ID>
end note

note right of Running
Rutas principales:

/          → App
/api/*     → API
/health    → API
end note

@enduml